<% hotel_location = [@hotel.address, @hotel.city, @hotel.state, @hotel.country].reject(&:blank?).join(', ') %>
<% stay_window = "#{@reservation.check_in_date.strftime('%B %d, %Y')} to #{@reservation.check_out_date.strftime('%B %d, %Y')}" %>
<% check_in_time = @hotel.check_in_time&.strftime('%-I:%M %p') || 'Contact the hotel for the check-in time' %>
<% check_out_time = @hotel.check_out_time&.strftime('%-I:%M %p') || 'Contact the hotel for the check-out time' %>
<% total_rate = number_to_currency(@reservation.total_amount) %>
<% balance_due = number_to_currency(@reservation.balance_due) %>
<% guest_count = pluralize(@reservation.total_guests, 'guest') %>
<% special_requests = @reservation.special_requests.presence || 'None provided' %>

<%= @hotel.name %> Reservation Updated

Hello <%= @guest.full_name %>,

Your reservation <%= @reservation.confirmation_number %> at <%= @hotel.name %> has been updated. Here is the latest summary:

Hotel: <%= @hotel.name %>
Location: <%= hotel_location.presence || 'Details on file' %>

Stay: <%= stay_window %> (<%= pluralize(@reservation.nights, 'night') %>)
Check-in Time: <%= check_in_time %>
Check-out Time: <%= check_out_time %>

Room Type: <%= @room_type.name %>
Guests: <%= guest_count %>
Status: <%= @reservation.status.titleize %>
Total Rate: <%= total_rate %> (<%= @reservation.currency %>)
Balance Due: <%= balance_due %>

Special Requests:
<%= special_requests %>

If anything above looks incorrect, reply to this email or call <%= @hotel.phone.presence || 'the front desk' %> so we can assist.

We look forward to welcoming you to <%= @hotel.name %>.

<%= @hotel.name %>
<%= hotel_location.presence || '' %>
<%= @hotel.phone.presence || '' %>
<%= @hotel.email.presence || '' %>
